<br>
If you want your results to be reproducible, you can use the `seed` parameter.

::: {#031e3efa .cell execution_count=3}
``` {.python .cell-code}
(df
 .sample(100, seed=42)
 )
```

::: {.cell-output .cell-output-display execution_count=3}
```{=html}
